ng.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/42px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/56px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\n<b>Spider Silk Cocoon</b> is an environmental object in and container <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.\n\n<center class=\"noexcerpt\">\n<table style=\"background: none;\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: top;\">“\n</td>\n<td><blockquote style=\"margin: 0; font-style: italic\">A bulbous, sticky sac of powerful silk. The surface seems to ripple softly, as if something were moving within.</blockquote>\n</td>\n<td style=\"color: #C1A878; font-size: 3.3em; font-family: serif; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 2px 2px; width: 0.5em; vertical-align: bottom;\">„\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right;\"><small>— <b>In-game description</b></small>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></center>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Spider Silk Cocoons are a few places, typically where <a href=\"/wiki/Spider\" title=\"Spider\">Spiders</a> live. Known locations are the <a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Depths\" title=\"Whispering Depths\">Whispering Depths</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>. \n</p><p>While primarily serving as environmental decoration, some act as containers and may contain loot. They cannot be picked up or moved but can be destroyed.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715002726\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.096 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.099 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3782/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35677/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16056/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 15/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8764/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 953728/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   94.849      1 -total\n 95.53%   90.607      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 59.32%   56.266      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 32.03%   30.376      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.20%   10.624      1 Template:Template_style\n  6.66%    6.315     52 Template:Plus_if_pos\n  4.59%    4.353      7 Template:Resistance\n  4.01%    3.807      2 Template:Credits\n  3.77%    3.573      1 Template:PageSeo\n  3.11%    2.948     17 Template:Trim\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:57022-0!canonical an